\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20210420142723&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Yeti_a875de.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"creature-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a yeti.</div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"><span class=\"tibiatext tibiaorange\"><ul class=\"sound-list\"><li>Yooodelaaahooohooo</li><li>Yooodelaaaheehee</li></ul></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>Very rare monsters, not considered a boss, although they spawn irregularly and don't appear in the Tibian Library. On <a href=\"#/wiki/Folda\">Folda</a>, they spawn in small groups, from 1 to 3. One <b>Yeti</b> group spawns close to the shovel hole, second group spawns little bit north east of the shovel hole and the third group spawns east of the shovel hole.\n</p><p>On <a href=\"#/wiki/Chyllfroest\">Chyllfroest</a>, they spawn very rarely on the fourth floor of the mountain.\n</p>\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-center wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-center wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\" data-seq-no=\"0\" hash=\"86a2fec0039adfbcd097ec5d3aa55969\" id=\"w-gallery-0\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:167px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:129px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Yeti_Dropping_Bunyslippers-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:121px; width:165px; top:3px;\"><img alt=\"Yeti Dropping Bunyslippers on Isle of Merriment, 2019\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-caption=\"Yeti Dropping Bunyslippers on Isle of Merriment, 2019\" height=\"127\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Yeti_Dropping_Bunyslippers_6856ed.png\" style=\"\" title=\"Yeti Dropping Bunyslippers.png (662 KB)\" width=\"165\"/></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:165px;\">Yeti Dropping Bunyslippers on Isle of Merriment, 2019</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:167px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:129px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Yeti_Bestiary_Entry-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:127px; width:165px;\"><img alt=\"Full Yeti Bestiary Entry\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-caption=\"Full Yeti Bestiary Entry\" height=\"127\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Yeti_Bestiary_Entry_8e6b69.png\" style=\"\" title=\"Yeti Bestiary Entry.png (1.44 MB)\" width=\"165\"/></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:165px;\">Full Yeti Bestiary Entry</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:167px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:129px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Yeti_wiki-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:127px; width:165px;\"><img alt=\"Yeti on Folda (Harmonia)\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-caption=\"Yeti on Folda (Harmonia)\" height=\"127\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Yeti_wiki_7ac028.png\" style=\"\" title=\"Yeti wiki.png (611 KB)\" width=\"165\"/></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:165px;\">Yeti on Folda (Harmonia)</div></div></div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-abilities\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Abilities\">Abilities</span></h3>\n<div class=\"ability_list\"><div class=\"creatureAbility\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\"><span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span> Melee</span> (0-300)</div>⁠, <div class=\"creatureAbility\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\"><span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a hr