9%); display:inline-block;\">100%?</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"1.0000\" title=\"Healing\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Healing <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Healing Icon\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Healing_Icon_be4df6.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:90.9091%; background-color:#ffffff; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 9.0909%); display:inline-block;\">100%</div></div></div>\n</div><div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Folda\">Folda</a> - <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32006,31596,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32006, 31596, 7)</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Chyllfroest\">Chyllfroest</a> - <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32070,31033,4\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32070, 31033, 4)</a>. <br/> <a href=\"#/wiki/Isle%20of%20Merriment\">Isle of Merriment</a> - <b>During a Test Servers Monster Rampage</b> <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"31925,31819,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (31925, 31819, 7)</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-behaviour\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Behaviour\">Behaviour</span></h3>\n<p>\tA yeti attacks in melee range. A yeti never retreats.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-strategy\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Strategy\">Strategy</span></h3>\n<p>\tWhile blocking <b>Yetis</b>, try to keep at one of their diagonals to avoid the <a href=\"#/wiki/Ice%20Damage\">Snow Wave</a>. <a href=\"#/wiki/Paladin\">Paladins</a> can kill them with <a href=\"#/wiki/Assassin%20Star\">Assassin Stars</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Ethereal%20Spear\">Ethereal Spear</a>. Mages should use <a href=\"#/wiki/Magic%20Shield\">Magic Shield</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Sudden%20Death\">Sudden Death Runes</a> to take them down quickly.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Loot\">Loot</span></h3>\n<p><small><i>Drop rates are estimated based on 117 samples <span class=\"loot-stats-link\">(Loot Statistics)</span>.</i></small> <small><i>Colour-coding is applied after 500 samples — current sample size is below this threshold.</i></small><br/><small><i>Task column indicates items used in delivery tasks.</i></small>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"text-align:center; width:auto;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th></th>\n<th>Item</th>\n<th>Task</th>\n<th>Quantity</th>\n<th>Avg</th>\n<th data-sort-type=\"number\">%\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"loot-table-icon\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\"><img alt=\"Gold Coin\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gold_Coin_a5b511.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></span></td>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a></td>\n<td></td>\n<td>1-27</td>\n<td>6.9</td>\n<td class=\"\" data-sort-value=\"76.068376\" style=\"text-align:center;\">76%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"loot-table-icon\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Meat\"><img alt=\"Meat\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Meat_7cb26b.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></span></td>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Meat\">Meat</a></td>\n<td></td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>0.69</td>\n<td class=\"\" data-sort-value=\"69.230769\" style=\"text-align:center;\">69%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"loot-table-icon\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Snowball\"><img alt=\"Snowball\" class=\"mw-fil